# ============================================================
# projd - Unity 6 (URP) .gitignore
# 需要提交：Assets/（含 .meta）、Packages/、ProjectSettings/、AGENTS/
# ============================================================

# ---- Unity 自动生成（可随时重建）----
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/

# ---- 构建产物 ----
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
*.app
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage

# ---- Unity 崩溃恢复场景 ----
/[Aa]ssets/_Recovery/
/[Aa]ssets/_Recovery.meta

# ---- Unity 杂项 ----
/[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

# 自动生成的 Burst 调试信息
/[Aa]ssets/*_BurstDebugInformation_DoNotShip*

# ---- IDE 自动生成的工程文件 ----
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
ExportedObj/
.consulo/

# ---- 编辑器 / IDE 个人配置 ----
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ---- 系统文件 ----
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# ---- self ----
AGENTS/

# ---- 临时：Game/ 暂时只提交代码（脚本 / 编辑器工具 / shader）----
# 美术资源工作流（LFS 等）确定后，删除这一段即可提交全部内容
/Assets/Game/*
!/Assets/Game/Scripts/
!/Assets/Game/Scripts.meta
!/Assets/Game/Editor/
!/Assets/Game/Editor.meta
!/Assets/Game/Shaders/
!/Assets/Game/Shaders.meta
